opencli-Razormind
https://github.com/2233admin/opencli-Razormind

The Java Agent Skill governance design in apps/control-api is adapted from the
Apache-2.0 licensed opencli-Razormind Skill subsystem as inspected at commit
573af24867f51325bbd46af9320d8fcb34f6d5bb. ThreadBeacon reimplements the concepts in
Java and PostgreSQL rather than copying the Python runtime. Adapted concepts
include the nine-element Skill card, journey_trace_v1, conservative write-before-
confirm policy, self-evaluation, failure-streak correction proposal, immutable
version snapshots, and rollback. ThreadBeacon stores evidence in an append-only table
to avoid concurrent JSON-array lost updates.
